    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bicistronic designs and the RBS context problem"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Directive \u2014 Test whether the entry-04 ladder transfers to a different CDS, and fix it if it does not."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The claim under test"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Entry 04 measured the RBS ladder against "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " only, and flagged that monocistronic RBS strength is a property of the RBS-CDS pair rather than of the RBS. This entry tests that flag instead of trusting it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Design"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The same ladder \u2014 "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-07149c5d",
              "label": "B0032m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-07149c5d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0032m_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-a21404dd",
              "label": "B0033m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-a21404dd",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0033m_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "label": "B0034m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0034m_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " \u2014 re-measured against "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-4ef35c11",
              "label": "E0040m (GFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-4ef35c11",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E0040m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-359938dd",
              "label": "eBFP2",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-359938dd",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/eBFP2_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Then repeated with the bicistronic "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-2d29c535",
              "label": "BCD2",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-2d29c535",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/BCD2_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-bfb0490f",
              "label": "BCD12",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-bfb0490f",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/BCD12_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Result"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The monocistronic ladder reorders between reporters: "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-a21404dd",
              "label": "B0033m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-a21404dd",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0033m_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " outperforms "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "label": "B0034m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0034m_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-359938dd",
              "label": "eBFP2",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-359938dd",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/eBFP2_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The ladder is not a property of the RBS."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The bicistronic designs hold their rank order across all three reporters, within 1.3-fold."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Consequence"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Any future unit whose CDS is not "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " uses a bicistronic design. The entry-04 numbers remain valid only for "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and are now annotated as such."
          }
        ]
      },
